---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Steph Pemberton | Steph Pemberton Art"
  description="Meet Steph Pemberton, an Australian artist painting layered oil and mixed media originals that speak of strength and grace."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Meet Steph</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-stone-600">
    Steph Pemberton paints art that empowers, brings beauty, and feeds the soul.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-6 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-stone-700">
    <p>
      Steph believes a home should build up the people in it. She paints for women
      who are becoming: layered oil and mixed media originals, usually with a
      subject at their centre, made to speak of strength and grace without saying
      a word.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each piece starts as an abstract ground of colour and texture, then finds its
      form in oil. No two works take the same path, and no original is ever repeated.
    </p>
    <p>
      Steph sells directly from her studio, so original art stays within reach of
      everyday collectors. Order confirmations and delivery updates arrive by email.
    </p>
    <!-- [NEED from Steph: where in Australia she lives and paints, how long she has
         painted, any training or exhibitions, and a studio portrait photo.] -->
  </div>
  <a href="/shop" class="mt-8 inline-block rounded bg-stone-900 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm text-white">Browse the collection</a>
</BaseLayout>
